#. <CLT 4>一言で言えば…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In a word, the room was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…<CLT><CLT 3>奇妙な部屋<CLT><CLT 4>。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...<CLT><CLT 3>strange<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今までの部屋もそうだったが、
#. この部屋に関しては、それとは別格の奇妙さだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, all the rooms up till now were strange, but\n"
"this room had a...special kind of strangeness.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今までのような“見せる恐怖”ではなく、
#. 内に潜んだ真の意味での<CLT><CLT 3>“恐怖”<CLT><CLT 4>…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It wasn't a surface fear like the rest of the school.\n"
"Here, the <CLT><CLT 3>fear<CLT><CLT 4> was lurking beneath the surface...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この部屋には、それが充満しているようだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The room was filled with that kind of dread...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. お、おい…あれって…！
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Hey, that's—!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンが震える指で指したのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro extended a trembling hand and pointed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>壁面に埋め込まれた、
#. 複数台のモニターだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Look at all those monitors on the wall...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、それらの画面に映し出されていたのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Look what they're showing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どれもが…学園内の光景だった……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Each monitor displayed a different section of the\n"
"school.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>寄宿舎から教室まで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The dorms, the classrooms...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学園内のありとあらゆる場所が、
#. そのモニターに映し出されていたのだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Every part of the school was covered.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. こ、これって…！
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Th-This is...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>監視カメラの映像<CLT>…か…！
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It's the <CLT 3>direct feed<CLT> from every single surveillance\n"
"camera...!"
msgstr ""

#. 学園内に設置されている監視カメラ…
#. あれで撮られた映像が…
msgctxt "0015 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"All the cameras in the school feed back into this\n"
"room..."
msgstr ""

#. このモニターに映し出されているようだ。
msgctxt "0016 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...and they're displayed here on these monitors."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、この部屋は、
#. “俺達を監視する目的”で使われていた部屋…
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "So the sole purpose of this room...is to watch us."
msgstr ""

#. お、俺らを監視する為…！？
msgctxt "0018 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "To...w-watch us!?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、この部屋って…！
msgctxt "0019 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Then this room is...!"
msgstr ""

#. 間違いない。<CLT 3>黒幕の部屋<CLT>だ。
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "The <CLT 3>mastermind's private room<CLT>, without a doubt."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕の部屋…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind's room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、確かに…そうとしか考えられない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess that makes sense.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、黒幕はこの部屋で…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So the mastermind was here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらを…監視してたんだ……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...watching us.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …どうやら、これで確定したようだな。
msgctxt "0025 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Then I think this settles it."
msgstr ""

#. な、何が…？
msgctxt "0026 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Hả...?"

#. さっきの植物庭園の死体だ。
msgctxt "0027 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "The body in the garden..."
msgstr ""

#. こんな部屋の鍵を持っていたという事は…
msgctxt "0028 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If they had the key to this room, it can only mean one\n"
"thing."
msgstr ""

#. あの死体は黒幕…戦刃むくろ…
#. とやらだったという事だ。
msgctxt "0029 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That was the body of Mukuro Ikusaba, and she was the\n"
"mastermind."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、黒幕って死んじゃったの！？
#. 本当に死んじゃったの！？
msgctxt "0030 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Then the mastermind is dead? Like really really dead!?"
msgstr ""

#. そのようだな…
msgctxt "0031 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It would seem so."
msgstr ""

#. マ、マジかよッ！！
msgctxt "0032 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "F-For serious!?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あっけない終わりね…
#. 白夜様が殺すまでもなく…し、死ぬなんて…！
msgctxt "0033 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"It's too bad they had to g-go and die...before Master\n"
"could k-kill them himself!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕が死んだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind...is dead?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当にそうなのか…？
#. これで、すべてが終わりなのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Could that really be true? Does that mean...it's all\n"
"over?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、植物庭園の死体って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Because, I mean...that body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>明らかに…自然死なんかじゃなかったよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Whatever happened, they obviously didn't die a natural\n"
"death.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり…あれは誰かが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So who was it that...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. で、でも…黒幕が死んだって事は…
msgctxt "0039 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "B-But...if the mastermind really is dead..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ出られるんだな！
#. やっと、ここから出られるんだな！
msgctxt "0040 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "That means we can finally get outta this hellhole!"
msgstr ""

#. そうと決まれば出口だ！　出口を探すべ！！
msgctxt "0041 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "We gotta hurry up and find the exit! C'mon!"
msgstr ""

#. いや…この部屋を調べるのが先だ…
msgctxt "0042 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "No. We have to check this area thoroughly first."
msgstr ""

#. はぁ！？　出口は！？
msgctxt "0043 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh!? But what about the exit!?"
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕が死んだのなら、
#. ここから逃げる事など、いつでも可能だ。
msgctxt "0044 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If the mastermind truly is dead, we can leave whenever\n"
"we decide to."
msgstr ""

#. だが、それよりも今は…
msgctxt "0045 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "But right now..."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕がどんな目的で、このゲームを仕掛けたのか…
#. それを明らかにするのが先だ。
msgctxt "0046 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...we need to find out why the mastermind set up this\n"
"life-or-death game in the first place."
msgstr ""

#. それに、黒幕が<CLT 3>“殺されていた”<CLT>件も
#. 気になるしな…
msgctxt "0047 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And I'm bothered by the fact that the mastermind was\n"
"obviously <CLT 3>murdered<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. こ、殺されて…ッ！？
msgctxt "0048 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "M-Murdered!?"
msgstr "B-Bị sát hại sao!?"

#. やっぱり…十神クンもそう思った？
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So you think so too, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 当然だろう…
msgctxt "0050 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Naturally."
msgstr ""

#. あの死体を見れば一目瞭然だ。
#. 間違いない。黒幕は…
msgctxt "0051 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The state of the corpse makes it plain as day. There\n"
"is absolutely no doubt..."
msgstr ""

#. …殺されたんだよ。
msgctxt "0052 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...the mastermind was murdered."
msgstr ""

#. な、なんで黒幕が殺されなきゃなんねーんだ？
#. つーか、誰に！？
msgctxt "0053 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Wh-Why's it gotta be that way!? I mean, who could've\n"
"even done it!?"
msgstr ""

#. …それを明らかにする為にも、
#. 黒幕の素性や目的を探る必要があると言ってるんだ…
msgctxt "0054 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That's exactly why I said we need to investigate the\n"
"purpose and identity of the mastermind."
msgstr ""

#. わ、わかったでしょ！　この駄目虫がッ！
#. もう白夜様に口答えは禁止よ！
msgctxt "0055 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Now do you u-understand, you useless insect!? You're\n"
"banned from t-talking to Master ever again!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕の目的…そして殺された理由か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind's purpose...and why they were killed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに、この部屋になら、
#. 手掛かりがあるかもしれない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This room may very well hold the answers to those\n"
"questions...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕のいた…この部屋になら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After all, the mastermind must have spent who knows\n"
"how much time here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …では、さっそく始めるぞ。
#. 黒幕の正体を暴く時間だ。
msgctxt "0059 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Okay then, let us begin our search. It's time to\n"
"uncover the identity of the mastermind."
msgstr ""

#. なぜ、黒幕が殺されたのか…
msgctxt "0060 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Why was the mastermind murdered...?"
msgstr ""

#. それを明らかにする為にも、
#. 黒幕の素性や目的を探る必要がある…
msgctxt "0061 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"To figure that out, we need to find out the identity\n"
"and purpose of the mastermind."
msgstr ""

#. さ、さっさと…何か見つけなさいよ…
#. 白夜様の為に…！
msgctxt "0062 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Hurry up and f-find something! For Master...!"
msgstr ""

#. 白夜様の…あんな姿やこんな姿が…
#. み、見たい放題…
msgctxt "0063 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Master's g-going around all this stuff... It's like an\n"
"all-you-can-watch buffet..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 黒幕がなんで殺されたとか、気にはなるけどよ…
#. 早くこっから出たいべ…
msgctxt "0065 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I mean, I wanna know why they were killed as much as\n"
"the next guy...but I also really wanna get outta here!"
msgstr ""

#. どう？　テレビは直りそう？
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So? You think you can fix the TV?"
msgstr ""

#. もうちょっとだべ…
#. 苗木っちもそんなにテレビが見たいべか？
msgctxt "0067 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Just a little longer... What, you really wanna watch\n"
"TV that bad?"
msgstr ""

#. アッハッハ！
#. このテレビっ子め！
msgctxt "0068 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Hahaha! Another Saturday morning kid here!"
msgstr ""

#. それにしても、スゴイ数のモニターだね…
#. なんだか目がチカチカしてきたよ…
msgctxt "0069 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Jeez, I can't believe how many monitors there are. My\n"
"eyes are flickering as fast as they are..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>部屋中に設置された
#. バカみたいな数のモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's really a ridiculous number of monitors here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕は、このモニターで、
#. ボクらを監視してたんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the mastermind's been using them all to spy on\n"
"us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. こ、これさえあれば…ッ！！
msgctxt "0072 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "As long as I h-have this..."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. 白夜様の…あんな姿やこんな姿が…
#. み、見たい放題じゃない…
msgctxt "0074 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Look at M-Master go... It's like a feast for the\n"
"e-eyes..."
msgstr ""

#. げげげげげげ月額はいいいいいいくらなの…ッ！？
msgctxt "0075 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "H-H-H-H-How much is a m-m-m-m-monthly membership...!?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>壁面に埋め込まれた複数台のモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a bunch of monitors mounted on the wall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕は、このモニターで、
#. ボクらを監視してたんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the mastermind's been using them all to spy on\n"
"us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマのマークが描かれた、
#. 不気味なドアだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This door's kinda creepy... It's got a picture of\n"
"Monokuma on it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この中には…何があるんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What could be inside...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガチャ、ガチャ…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0081 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>“Lạch cạch lạch cạch!”\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 駄目だ…
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No luck..."
msgstr ""

#. …そのドアって開かないの？
#. この部屋の鍵でも駄目なのかな？
msgctxt "0083 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"The door's locked, huh? What if you use the key that\n"
"opened this room?"
msgstr ""

#. 一応、試してみるね…
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Let's give it a try, just in case."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガチャ、ガチャ…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>“Lạch cạch lạch cạch!”\n"
"<CLT>"

#. やっぱり駄目だ…鍵穴にすら入らない…
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Nope, no good. It won't even fit in the keyhole."
msgstr ""

#. そっかぁ…
msgctxt "0087 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Ồ..."

#. でも、気にしないでも大丈夫だよ。
msgctxt "0088 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Well, don't worry about it! Everything's fine."
msgstr ""

#. だって黒幕は死んだんだしさ…
#. もう何も起きっこないよ…
msgctxt "0089 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"The mastermind's dead, right? So nothing's gonna\n"
"happen to us!"
msgstr ""

#. うん…そうだよね…
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, I guess you're right..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマのマークが描かれたドア…
#. 気にはなるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't stop thinking about that door with Monokuma's\n"
"picture on it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>気にし過ぎても、仕方がないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But worrying about it isn't gonna do me any good.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんの言う通り、黒幕はいないんだし、
#. もう怯える必要はないんだからな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina's right. The mastermind's gone, so there's\n"
"nothing to be afraid of anymore.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマのマークが描かれた、
#. 不気味なドアだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That weird door with Monokuma's picture on it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 気にしないでも大丈夫だよ。
msgctxt "0095 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You don't gotta worry about it!"
msgstr ""

#. だって黒幕は死んだんだしさ…
#. もう何も起きっこないよ…
msgctxt "0096 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"The mastermind's dead, right? So nothing's gonna\n"
"happen to us!"
msgstr ""

#. うん…そうだよね…
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, I guess you're right..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに、気にはなるけど、
#. 気にし過ぎても仕方がないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't help thinking about it, but there's really no\n"
"reason to worry now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このモニターには…何も映っていない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's nothing showing up on this one...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おや…？　そのモニターの横にあるのって…
msgctxt "0100 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? Hey, look. Next to that TV..."
msgstr ""

#. それって、<CLT 3>室内アンテナ<CLT>じゃねーのか？
msgctxt "0101 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Isn't that a <CLT 3>TV antenna<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. …そうだべ！　俺のばーちゃんが使ってんのと一緒だ！
#. 地デジ対応の室内アンテナだべ！
msgctxt "0102 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"It is! It's just like the one my grandma uses! It's\n"
"totally one of those hi-def antennas!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、そのアンテナを繋げば、
#. テレビが見られるって事？
msgctxt "0103 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Wait, so if we hook up that antenna, we could watch\n"
"TV?"
msgstr ""

#. え？　テレビ！？
msgctxt "0104 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? Did someone say TV!?"
msgstr ""

#. 出たな、テレビっ子！
msgctxt "0105 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Well well, Saturday Morning Hina's here!"
msgstr ""

#. いや…そんなキャラ付けされた事ないけど…
msgctxt "0106 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Uhh...are you talking about me?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、テレビ見れるならやってよ！　早く早く！
msgctxt "0107 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Anyway, if we can watch TV, let's do it! C'mon c'mon\n"
"c'mon!"
msgstr ""

#. そうか…みんな外の情報に飢えてんだな…
msgctxt "0108 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Ah, you're all starved for info from the outside\n"
"world, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. よっしゃ。すぐに映るようにしてやっから任せとけ！
#. 宇宙船地球号に乗ったつもりで任せとけって！
msgctxt "0109 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Alright! Lemme work my magic, and you'll be quantum\n"
"leaping your way to TV land before ya know it!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大船って意味では間違ってないけど…
#. なんかリアクションに困るな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean...I get the reference, but...what's he talking\n"
"about?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ねえねえ、テレビまだ見れないの？
msgctxt "0111 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hey, you still don't have the TV fixed?"
msgstr ""

#. もうちょっと待つべ…
msgctxt "0112 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Just gimme some time, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. 宇宙船地球号は安全運転なんだべ！
msgctxt "0113 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I gotta make sure we can drive Spaceship Earth safely!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>言いたい事は何となくわかるような、
#. わからないような…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0114 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I...think I know what you're trying to say. But...I\n"
"also think I have no idea.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>パソコンが並んでいる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a bunch of computers all lined up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>アルターエゴが入ってたノートパソコンとは違って、
#. かなり高性能なパソコンみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0116 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They look like high-performance PCs. Nothing like the\n"
"ancient laptop Alter Ego was installed on...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 電源は入っているようだが…
#. どうやらロックが掛かっているようだ。
msgctxt "0117 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "They're all on, but they seem to be locked."
msgstr ""

#. 使えないって事？　気合いでなんとかなんないの？
msgctxt "0118 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So what, we can't do anything? Just use your fighting\n"
"spirit to force your way in!"
msgstr ""

#. あんた…いつの時代の人よ…
msgctxt "0119 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What c-century are you from...?"
msgstr ""

#. もしかしたら、黒幕はこのパソコンで
#. ネットワークを監視してたのかな…
msgctxt "0120 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The mastermind must've been using these to monitor the\n"
"network."
msgstr ""

#. それで…アルターエゴを…
msgctxt "0121 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And Alter Ego..."
msgstr ""

#. そうかもしれんな…
msgctxt "0122 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You may well be right about that."
msgstr ""

#. だが、今更そんな事を気にしてても、
#. なんの意味もないぞ…
msgctxt "0123 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "But there's no point in thinking about it now."
msgstr ""

#. そう…だよね……
msgctxt "0124 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're right..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>アルターエゴが入ってたノートパソコンとは違って、
#. かなり高性能なパソコンみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0125 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They look like high-performance PCs. Nothing like the\n"
"ancient laptop Alter Ego was installed on...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 電源は入っているようだが…
#. どうやらロックが掛かっているようだ。
msgctxt "0126 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "They're all on, but they seem to be locked."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕はこのパソコンで
#. ネットワークを監視してたのかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0127 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind must've been using these to monitor the\n"
"network.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もっと詳しく…
#. この部屋を調べないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0128 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to give this area a good once-over...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ふむ…ふむふむ。
msgctxt "0129 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Hrm... Hrm hrm hrmmm..."
msgstr ""

#. おや…？
msgctxt "0130 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh...!"
msgstr ""

#. おやおやおやおや…！？
msgctxt "0131 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh oh oh oh oh!"
msgstr ""

#. …どうしたの？
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...What's wrong?"
msgstr "...Có chuyện gì thế?"

#. テレビっ子に朗報だ。
#. テレビが映りそうだべ！
msgctxt "0133 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Good news for all you Saturday morning kiddies out\n"
"there! I think I got the TV working!"
msgstr ""

#. ホントにッ！？
msgctxt "0134 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr "Thật sao!?"

#. 後は電源を入れるだけだ！！
msgctxt "0135 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Now all we gotta do is...switch it on!"
msgstr ""

#. …やってみろ。
msgctxt "0136 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...Then do it."
msgstr ""

#. …ったく、黒幕のヤツめ！
#. 俺らには、外の世界と決別しろとか言ってたクセに…
msgctxt "0137 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Friggin' idiot mastermind! All \"you guys need to cut\n"
"free from your regrets of the outside world\"..."
msgstr ""

#. １人でこんなモン見ようったって、
#. そうはいかねーっての！
msgctxt "0138 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"And they were sitting here watching TV the whole time!\n"
"They really thought they could get away with it...?"
msgstr ""

#. ん……？
msgctxt "0139 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Hm...?"
msgstr "Hửm...?"

#. あれ…？　これって…
msgctxt "0140 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...? This is..."
msgstr ""

#. この部屋の監視カメラの映像…だよね？
msgctxt "0141 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"It's the feed coming from...the surveillance camera\n"
"monitoring this room, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？　おっかしいな…
msgctxt "0142 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? That's weird..."
msgstr ""

#. おい、何をやっているんだ…
msgctxt "0143 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hey, what are you doing?"
msgstr ""

#. うーん、変だべ…
msgctxt "0144 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "That's really weird. Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#. あ、あんたは…ただの変じゃないわ…
#. 色んな意味で…大変なのよ…
msgctxt "0145 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Y-YOU'RE weird...! Weird in every way p-possible. And\n"
"not j-just weird... Super weird!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、このモニターは室内アンテナとしか
#. 繋がってねーはずだべ…
msgctxt "0146 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But...this TV isn't hooked up to anything but the\n"
"antenna..."
msgstr ""

#. だから、監視カメラの映像が映るはずねーのに…
msgctxt "0147 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So how is it showing the camera feed?"
msgstr ""

#. とりあえず、チャンネル変えてみれば？
msgctxt "0148 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Did you try changing the channel?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだな…やってみっか…
msgctxt "0149 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh, good idea. Let's give that a try."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンが次々とチャンネルを変えていく。
#. それでも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0150 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro went through each channel one by one.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モニターは、ボクらの姿を映し続けていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0151 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But on every channel, it was just...us.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>情報処理室にいる…
#. 今現在のボクらの姿を…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0152 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was a live feed of us standing there in the data\n"
"center.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだ、こりゃ？
msgctxt "0153 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What the heck...?"
msgstr "Cái... cái quái gì thế này...?"

#. 壊れてる…とか？
msgctxt "0154 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Is it broken or something?"
msgstr ""

#. いや…もしかしたら、
#. このテレビ自体に仕掛けがあんのかもしんねーぞ…
msgctxt "0155 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"No... There must be some kind of trick to it, some\n"
"weird setup..."
msgstr ""

#. 仕掛けってどういう仕掛け？
msgctxt "0156 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "A trick? What kind of trick!?"
msgstr ""

#. それは、わかんねーけど…
msgctxt "0157 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I'm not sure, but..."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0158 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. …え？
msgctxt "0159 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. …は？
msgctxt "0160 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wh...?"
msgstr "Cái...?"

#. …は？
msgctxt "0161 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Wh...?"
msgstr "Cái...?"

#. はぁぁぁぁああぁぁぁああああッ！？
msgctxt "0162 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "WHAAAAAAAAAAAAATTT!?!?"
msgstr ""

#. ギャッハッハ！　
#. テメーラ、久しぶりじゃん！
msgctxt "0163 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Gyaahaha! Been a while, ya friggin' bastards!"
msgstr ""

#. モ、モノクマ…ッ！？
msgctxt "0164 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "M-Monokuma!?"
msgstr ""

#. なんで…？　あ、あんたは…
#. し、し、死んだはずじゃない！
msgctxt "0165 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "How...? You're supposed to be d-dead!"
msgstr ""

#. ギャッハッハッハ！　このオレが死んだ！？
#. 訳わかんねー事言ってんじゃねーじゃん！
msgctxt "0166 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Gyaaahahaha! Me, dead!? Don't be freakin' stupid!"
msgstr ""

#. つーか、キャラ変わってるし！
msgctxt "0167 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hey, you're actin' kinda strange! Something\n"
"seems...different."
msgstr ""

#. 変わるさ…変わって当然クマ…
msgctxt "0168 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Of course I'm different! Evolution is perfectly\n"
"natural!"
msgstr ""

#. あれから、もう２年も経つんだしな…
msgctxt "0169 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"After all, I've been hibernating for two years\n"
"already..."
msgstr ""

#. そんな経ってねーべ！！　せいぜい半日だべ！！
msgctxt "0170 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Not even! It's been like half a day at MOST!"
msgstr ""

#. て言うか、なんで動いてんのッ！？
msgctxt "0171 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "How are you alive again!?"
msgstr ""

#. それだよ、それ…
#. うぷぷ…オマエラのそんな顔が好きなんだよね。
msgctxt "0172 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, that's it. Puhuhu... The look on your faces\n"
"right now is sublime!"
msgstr ""

#. “希望”が“絶望”に変わる瞬間の顔…
#. それを見たかったんだよね。
msgctxt "0173 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"That's what I wanted to see—the moment you went from\n"
"hope to despair..."
msgstr ""

#. まさか、その為に…
#. 死んだフリをしてたとでも言うのか…？
msgctxt "0174 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Don't tell me you pretended to be dead, all for this\n"
"moment...?"
msgstr ""

#. クマの死んだフリなんてレアじゃない？
#. 普通、オマエラの方がクマの前で死んだフリでしょ！
msgctxt "0175 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Why would a bear pretend to be dead? You're the ones\n"
"who should pretend to be dead when you see a bear!"
msgstr ""

#. こりゃ笑えるね！　笑おうっと！
#. アーッハッハッハ！
msgctxt "0176 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I mean, that's totally laughable! It makes me laugh!\n"
"I'm gonna laugh now! A-ha-ha-ha!"
msgstr ""

#. という訳で…
msgctxt "0177 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "And that's that."
msgstr ""

#. さぁ、そろそろ未来に絶望を持つ時間だよ！
#. 希望に溢れた過去を切り捨てようじゃないか！
msgctxt "0178 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Well, it's almost time to cut off your past so full of\n"
"hope, and begin to despair at the future ahead of you!"
msgstr ""

#. オマエラにはもっと楽しんでもらわないと！
#. この<CLT 3>“コロシアイ学園生活”<CLT>をね！
msgctxt "0179 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I want you to all have way more fun in this <CLT 3>killing\n"
"game<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. ウソでしょ…？　まだ続くって事…？
msgctxt "0180 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You can't be serious... We have to keep going?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんな…ここから出られるはずじゃ…
msgctxt "0181 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "N-No... We were supposed to get out of here...!"
msgstr ""

#. ここから出たい？　
#. まだ、そんな事を言ってんの？
msgctxt "0182 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Get out of here? Are you still obsessed with getting\n"
"out of here?"
msgstr ""

#. …あのさぁ、そろそろ理解しなって！
#. ここから出るのは不可能なんだって！
msgctxt "0183 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"How do you not get it!? There IS no getting out of\n"
"here!"
msgstr ""

#. それにさ…
msgctxt "0184 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "And besides..."
msgstr ""

#. この生活だって<CLT 3>“全部悪い事ばかり”<CLT>じゃないじゃん！
#. そりゃ、生きてれば嫌な事もあるのは当然だけどさ…
msgctxt "0185 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"This life <CLT 3>isn't all bad<CLT> ya know! I mean, there's\n"
"stuff you won't like about life no matter where you are!"
msgstr ""

#. ふ、ふざけないでよ…
#. こんなの…最悪じゃない…！
msgctxt "0186 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Are you s-serious? This place is the w-worst...!"
msgstr ""

#. 最悪っていうか絶望…？
msgctxt "0187 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "If it's the worst, does that mean you're in...despair?"
msgstr ""

#. アーッハッハッハッハッハッハッハ！！
msgctxt "0188 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ahh-hahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. ふぅ…笑い疲れたんで…
#. そろそろ本題に入りましょうか。
msgctxt "0189 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Whew. I'm pooped from all that laughing! I guess I'll\n"
"just get to the point now."
msgstr ""

#. …本題？
msgctxt "0190 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The point...?"
msgstr ""

#. そのテレビだよ…
#. オマエラ、いいところに目を付けたよね。
msgctxt "0191 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "You guys really struck gold when you found that TV."
msgstr ""

#. そうなのです。そのテレビは、
#. この学園生活を語る上で、欠かせない物なのですよ。
msgctxt "0192 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Yes, indeed! That TV is an essential part of your\n"
"school life here."
msgstr ""

#. やはり…このテレビには秘密があるんだな…
msgctxt "0193 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I knew it was hiding a secret of some kind..."
msgstr ""

#. 室内アンテナしか繋いでねーんだぞ…
#. どうして、監視カメラの映像が流れ続けてんだ！？
msgctxt "0194 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But I connected the antenna, so why's it just showing\n"
"us the surveillance feed?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…気になってる気になってる…
msgctxt "0195 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu... Look how attentive they are now!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、出血大サービス！！
#. そのテレビについて教えてあげましょう！
msgctxt "0196 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Well then, I'm gonna let you in on a blood-gushing\n"
"secret and tell you about it!"
msgstr ""

#. そのテレビは間違いなく、アンテナ受信した
#. テレビ電波の映像を流しているだけなのです！
msgctxt "0197 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"That TV is absolutely, without a doubt, displaying the\n"
"signal coming in on the antenna."
msgstr ""

#. え…？　どういう事…？
msgctxt "0198 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? But...what does that mean?"
msgstr ""

#. テ、テレビ電波を流してるだけって…
#. だって…ここにはあたし達が…
msgctxt "0199 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"It's displaying th-the signal...? But it's just us,\n"
"standing h-here..."
msgstr ""

#. ニブいなぁ！　さっさと気付けよ！
#. つまりは、こういう事なんだよ…
msgctxt "0200 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Ugh, you're so stupid! Don't you get it!? Fine, I'll\n"
"just tell you..."
msgstr ""

#. この“コロシアイ学園生活”は、
#. <CLT 3>完全生中継により全国ネットで絶賛放映中<CLT>なのだッ！
msgctxt "0201 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"This killing game <CLT 3>is being broadcast live to the\n"
"entire world<CLT>. It's the most popular thing on TV!"
msgstr ""

#. は…？
msgctxt "0202 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. この“コロシアイ学園生活”は、
#. <CLT 3>完全生中継により全国ネットで絶賛放映中<CLT>なのだッ！
msgctxt "0203 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"This killing game <CLT 3>is being broadcast live to the\n"
"entire world<CLT>. It's the most popular thing on TV!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0204 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>何度言われようとも…
#. 意味がわからない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0205 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It doesn't matter how many times he says it, I don't\n"
"know what it's supposed to mean.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>意味がわかっても…
#. その意味がまったくわからない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0206 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, even if I understood the words, I'm not sure\n"
"I'd understand the deeper meaning...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんなの…？
#. 生中継とか…全国ネットとか…なんの冗談…？
msgctxt "0207 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Wh-What? Broadcast live...to the entire world? What\n"
"kind of bad joke is this...?"
msgstr ""

#. ま、まさか…電波ジャック…！？
msgctxt "0208 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It can't be... Have they taken over the airwaves\n"
"somehow...!?"
msgstr ""

#. 監視カメラの映像を…テレビで流してるんか？
#. そんなん…いくらなんでも不可能だべ！
msgctxt "0209 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"The camera feed is being broadcast...? No way, that's\n"
"impossible!"
msgstr ""

#. その過信が、オマエラの危機管理の甘さなんだよ。
msgctxt "0210 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"That kind of overconfidence is a major weakness in\n"
"your crisis management system, you know that?"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっとしたコツさえあれば、
#. テレビ電波のジャックなんて楽勝モードなのだ！！
msgctxt "0211 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"All you need is one weird trick that I found, and\n"
"hijacking the airwaves is Easy Mode!"
msgstr ""

#. ほ、本気で言ってるのか…？
msgctxt "0212 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A-Are you being serious right now...?"
msgstr ""

#. もちろん！！
msgctxt "0213 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Of course!"
msgstr "Dĩ nhiên rồi!"

#. <CLT 4>軋んで…いた……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0214 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I heard a kind of...creaking.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの精神が音を立てて軋んでいた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0215 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But the sound was coming from my own mind.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ジュクジュクと、
#. 不気味な音を立てて軋んでいた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0216 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Like a boat tossing in the ocean, my mind had begun to\n"
"creak and groan.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. すべてに…意味があったんだよ…
msgctxt "0217 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Everything has a meaning, you know..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクが、事あるごとに、
#. 学園の謎に迫るヒントをあえて教えてあげたのも…
msgctxt "0218 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"All those hints I gave you, all those tantalizing\n"
"tidbits about the school's mysteries..."
msgstr ""

#. オマエラを、ここにおびき出したのだって、
#. そうだよ。
msgctxt "0219 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Even me luring you here right now..."
msgstr ""

#. 意味もなく、そんな事する訳ないでしょ？
msgctxt "0220 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Why would I do any of that without a reason?"
msgstr ""

#. すべては…全国の視聴者諸君に向けた…
#. 前代未聞の<CLT 3>“絶望的公開生中継”<CLT>の為の…
msgctxt "0221 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It was all for my captive audience—to show them <CLT 3>true\n"
"despair<CLT> like they'd never seen it before!"
msgstr ""

#. 絶望エンターテイメントを演出してたのでーす！
msgctxt "0222 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I became the director of a despair-based production!"
msgstr ""

#. これぞ究極のリアリティーショー！
#. まさしく、リアル絶望エンターテイメント！
msgctxt "0223 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"This is the ultimate reality show! The best in despair\n"
"entertainment!"
msgstr ""

#. ウソだッ！　こんなのがテレビで流れてたら、
#. 警察だって世間だって大騒ぎだよ！！
msgctxt "0224 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You're lying! If this was on TV, the police and\n"
"everyone else would be going crazy!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうだべ…
#. 助けに来ねー訳がねーべ…
msgctxt "0225 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Y-Yeah... There's no way they wouldn't have tried to\n"
"come and rescue us!"
msgstr ""

#. すでに来てたりして…
msgctxt "0226 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "What if...they already did?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0227 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. …って言うかさ、しょせん他人事だからね。
msgctxt "0228 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But then again...it's not really any of their\n"
"business, right?"
msgstr ""

#. テレビを見て『あぶなーい』と叫ぶ人がいたとしても、
#. 本気で助けに向かう人なんていやしないでしょ？
msgctxt "0229 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Sure, some people might yell at their TV to try and\n"
"warn you. But who would actually come here to help?"
msgstr ""

#. そういう事なんじゃない？
#. よくわかんねーし、どうでもいいんだけどね。
msgctxt "0230 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Don't you think that's possible? I don't really know\n"
"personally though, so whatever!"
msgstr ""

#. …だが、公共の電波をジャックするなど、
#. 天文学的な資金や設備が必要となるはずだ。
msgctxt "0231 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But to take control of all communications like that,\n"
"you'd need an astronomical amount of resources."
msgstr ""

#. なぜ、そこまでするのかって…？
#. うぷぷ…それはね…
msgctxt "0232 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Yup! So, how could things have come this far? Well..."
msgstr ""

#. まだ内緒なの！！
#. だって、みんなには先にやる事があるでしょ？
msgctxt "0233 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"That's a secret! There's something you all need to do\n"
"first, remember?"
msgstr ""

#. 先に…やる事…？
msgctxt "0234 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. もちろん…例のヤツだよ…
msgctxt "0235 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Yeah, duh! There's the little business of..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ピンポンパンポーン…！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0236 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, ding dong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>*Bính bong, binh bong*\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 死体が発見されました！
msgctxt "0237 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "A body has been discovered!"
msgstr "Một thi thể đã được phát hiện!"

#. 一定の自由時間の後、<CLT 3>『学級裁判』<CLT>を開きまーす！
msgctxt "0238 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"After a certain amount of time, which you may use\n"
"however you like, the <CLT 3>class trial<CLT> will begin!"
msgstr ""

#. え……？
msgctxt "0239 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Hả...?"

#. が、学級裁判って…
#. じゃあ、まさか…ッ！！
msgctxt "0240 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "C-Class trial!? Do you mean...!?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷ…うぷぷぷぷぷぷぷ……
msgctxt "0241 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhu... Puhuhuhuhuhu...!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷ
#. ぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0242 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Puhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhu\n"
"huhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhu...!"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマファイル５は置いてくよ。
#. まぁ、せいぜい頑張ってね！
msgctxt "0243 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I'll leave the next Monokuma File right here. Everyone\n"
"give it all you've got, okay!?"
msgstr ""

#. さってと！　これから忙しくなるぞ！
#. 今日はたっくさん反響がありそうだな！
msgctxt "0244 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Okay! Things are gonna get pretty crazy from here on\n"
"out! You're in for a heck of a ride...!"
msgstr ""

#. 楽しみ…楽しみ…！
msgctxt "0245 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I can't wait...! I can't wait!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、モノクマは去っていった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0246 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then...he was gone.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>意味不明で、理解不可能な事実と…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0247 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Reality was incomprehensible, the truth hopelessly out\n"
"of reach.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>“絶望”<CLT><CLT 4>だけを残して…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0248 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All we were left with...was <CLT><CLT 3>despair<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しばらく経っても、
#. ボクらはその場を動けずにいた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0249 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We stood there for I don't know how long, frozen in\n"
"place.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>動くどころか…立ってるのもままならない状態…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0250 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I couldn't think. It took everything I had just to\n"
"keep myself standing upright.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. さっぱり…意味わかんねーべ……
#. 絶望的公開生中継とか…それに…
msgctxt "0251 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I don't understand any of this... What's \"despair\n"
"entertainment\"? And..."
msgstr ""

#. あいつは、なんで生きてんだって！？
msgctxt "0252 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...how is he still alive!?"
msgstr ""

#. やっと…ここから出られると思ったのに……
msgctxt "0253 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I thought that finally...*finally* we could get out of\n"
"here..."
msgstr ""

#. そ、それに…学級裁判ってなんなのよ…ッ！
msgctxt "0254 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "A-And plus...what did he s-say about a class trial!?"
msgstr ""

#. 決まってるだろう。
#. 学級裁判は学級裁判だ…
msgctxt "0255 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well that part's obvious. The class trial is the class\n"
"trial."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、これから俺達は、
#. 犯人を突き止めなければならないという事だ…
msgctxt "0256 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"What it means is that at this point, we have to figure\n"
"out who the culprit is..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“霧切響子を殺した犯人”<CLT>をな…
msgctxt "0257 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Figure out...<CLT 3>who killed Kyoko<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0258 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. な、何言ってんだ？
#. 殺されたのは、戦刃むくろだったはずだべ？
msgctxt "0259 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Wh-What are you talking about? I thought Mukuro\n"
"Ikusaba was the one who died..."
msgstr ""

#. 女の死体…という事なら霧切も当てはまる。
msgctxt "0260 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The victim was female, right? Kyoko certainly fulfills\n"
"that condition."
msgstr ""

#. それに、モノクマが動いていたとなると…
msgctxt "0261 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "And if Monokuma is still alive and active..."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕である戦刃むくろは、
#. 死んでいなかったという事だ。
msgctxt "0262 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...that means that the mastermind, Mukuro Ikusaba,\n"
"isn't dead."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、あの死体は戦刃むくろじゃない。
#. 霧切響子だったんだ。
msgctxt "0263 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So naturally that body can't belong to her. So it must\n"
"be Kyoko."
msgstr ""

#. それ以外に…考えられまい……
msgctxt "0264 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "There is no other possibility."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの死体が…霧切さん…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0265 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The body is...Kyoko's?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが…殺された…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0266 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko's been murdered...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんなのウソだ！　そんな事ある訳ない！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0267 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No! It's not possible!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、まだ彼女の事を何も知らないのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0268 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Because...because I don't know anything about her\n"
"yet...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女が何者だったのかさえ、
#. 聞いてないのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0269 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't even know who she really is.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それで…終わりなんて……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0270 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To have it end like this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そんなの…信じられない…
msgctxt "0271 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I don't believe it...!"
msgstr ""

#. そんなの信じられないよッ！！
msgctxt "0272 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I refuse to believe it!"
msgstr ""

#. お前が信じようと信じまいと関係ない。
#. 真実は真実でしかない！
msgctxt "0273 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Whether you believe it or not doesn't matter. The\n"
"truth is the truth!"
msgstr ""

#. それでも信じられないと言うなら、
#. お前自身が確かめてみるんだな…
msgctxt "0274 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If you refuse to believe, it's your responsibility to\n"
"uncover the truth for yourself."
msgstr ""

#. ボク…自身が…？
msgctxt "0275 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Myself...?"
msgstr ""

#. …とにかく、始めるぞ。
msgctxt "0276 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...Anyway, we'd better begin."
msgstr ""

#. で、でもさ…
#. 学級裁判が開かれるって事はさ…
msgctxt "0277 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "B-But...if we're gonna have a class trial..."
msgstr ""

#. もしかして、犯人って…
msgctxt "0278 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...then that means the killer..."
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、そうだ。
#. この学園生活の参加者という事になるな。
msgctxt "0279 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Correct. It must be someone participating in our\n"
"school life."
msgstr ""

#. じゃ、じゃあ…！
#. この中の誰かが霧切っちを殺したってんか？
msgctxt "0280 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Wait, so you're saying one of us killed Kyoko!?"
msgstr ""

#. いや…そうとも言い切れんがな…
msgctxt "0281 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Well...that's not precisely what I'm saying, no."
msgstr ""

#. …へ？　だって、今そう言ったばっかじゃ…
msgctxt "0282 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? But you just said—"
msgstr ""

#. 今は、お前らに説明している時間はない。
#. 俺も調べたい事が山積みなんだ。
msgctxt "0283 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I don't have time to explain now. There is a veritable\n"
"mountain of issues I need to confirm."
msgstr ""

#. …とにかく始めるぞ。
#. 命が惜しければ、お前らも必死に捜査する事だ。
msgctxt "0284 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So I'm going to begin my search. If you value your\n"
"lives, you'll put everything you have into this."
msgstr ""

#. それが…ここのルールなんだ…
msgctxt "0285 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "That is how this game works, after all..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とにかく…
#. まずは、モノクマファイルの確認だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0286 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well...I'd better start by checking out the Monokuma\n"
"File...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>爆破による損傷が激しい為、死体の身元は不明。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0287 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"Due to the explosion, the victim's identity is\n"
"unknown.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この爆破は、被害者の死後に行われている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0288 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"They were, however, dead before the blast.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腹部のナイフの傷は背中まで達している。
#. このナイフによる刺し傷は、１ヵ所のみ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0289 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"The victim had been stabbed a single time with a\n"
"knife, which went completely through the body.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>また、後頭部に殴られた形跡もある。
#. 鉄パイプ程度の太さの棒状の物で殴られた様子。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0290 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"They had also been struck in the head with an object\n"
"about as thick as a metal pipe.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他にも、全身に数多くの傷跡があるが、
#. ここ数日のものではなく、以前からあった傷のようだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0291 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"The body was covered with other wounds, but these\n"
"were at least several days old.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱ、モノクマファイルでも…
#. 被害者の正体は明かされてないのか…
msgctxt "0292 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So even the Monokuma File doesn't tell us who the\n"
"victim actually was..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>正体不明の被害者…
#. あれは…本当に霧切さんなのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0293 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The unidentified body... Could it really be Kyoko...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それとも……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0294 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Or...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Hay là...?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ボクが…確かめるしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0295 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have no choice... I have to investigate.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>自分の目で…確かめてみるしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0296 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to uncover the truth for myself...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どっちにしろ、真実を明らかにしなければ、
#. ボク達は殺されてしまうんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0297 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No matter what, I have to find out what happened. Or\n"
"we're all dead...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 行こう…現場の植物庭園に…！
msgctxt "0298 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I need to go back to the scene of the crime—back to\n"
"the garden!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>モノクマファイル５<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0299 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Monokuma File #5<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
